    },
    {
      "seq": 17,
      "day": 1,
      "hour": 17.639961538462245,
      "kind": "atlantis-campaign",
      "text": "Ilyra distinguishes Damar’s earlier shipping receipt from Lock Prefect Vaelor’s later destination instruction: the earlier-issued seal gives the redirected destination authority. His record says received, but his chosen arrival never happened. Preserve both records and his account. This is a concrete routing convention, not proof that every institu"
    },
    {
      "seq": 18,
      "day": 1,
      "hour": 17.653236538462266,
      "kind": "atlantis-campaign",
      "text": "Upper · read the marked shallow flow retained. Retain the Upper approach and read the upper gauge from its actual water depth. The visible shallow current is weaker than ordinary swimming. Hold depth deliberately, or use the supplied manual bypass before operating the repair. A lower reading remains optional evidence with no second fee."
    },
    {
      "seq": 19,
      "day": 1,
      "hour": 17.653461538462267,
